title: FirstVillager
---
<<declare $hasChosenName = false>>
<<declare $playerName = "">>
<<declare $characterFLName = "">>
<<declare $foundTeleporter = false>>
<<declare $toldVillagerAboutTeleporter = false>>
<<if $hasChosenName == false>>
Lost Villager: Finally I am not alone and there is someone else here with me. 
Lost Villager: I don't know what happened, but this place is so beautiful I am seeing double.
Lost Villager: It is all a blur as I was gone before I could gather my thoughts.
Lost Villager: However, you seem vaguely familiar like we have meet before.
Lost Villager: What is your name? As that might help to recall something.

<<enter_player_name GameManager>>
<<set $hasChosenName = true>>
{$playerName}: My name is {$playerName}. //Player can be used as a fixed name in the beginning
Lost Villager: Ah {$playerName} that does ring a bell.
Lost Villager: That and someone new to the area wanting to tackle the tower.
Lost Villager: It's good to see you, {$playerName}. I think you also had someone in tow when you arrived.
Lost Villager: A woman I believe who was with you...
Lost Villager: Do you remember their name?
<<enter_character_fl_name GameManager>>
{$playerName}: Her name is {$characterFLName}.
Lost Villager: {$characterFLName}...
Lost Villager: Ah yes you two had just arrived recently.
Lost Villager: Hopefully you can find her soon and get out of here.
Lost Villager: I would go with you to look for her, but I am not gonna lie my brain is fuzzy and buzzing.
Lost Villager: I think I might just rest here for a moment to see if my body can align with where ever we are.
Lost Villager: Let me know if you find anything else hopefully you find a way out.
<<elseif $foundTeleporter == true && $toldVillagerAboutTeleporter == false>>
Lost Villager: Ah, {$playerName}. Good to see you again.
Lost Villager: Have you managed to find anything while exploring?
    -> Tell the villager about the teleporter
        {$playerName}: Actually, I think I found a way out of here.
        Lost Villager: Really? You found something?
        {$playerName}: There's a strange teleporter nearby. I think it might lead us out of this place.
        Lost Villager: A teleporter? That's certainly unexpected.
        Lost Villager: But if it means we can finally leave this place, I'm willing to give it a try.
        Lost Villager: Thank you, {$playerName}. I was beginning to think we'd be stuck here forever.
        Lost Villager: I'll gather myself and see if I can make my way there.
        <<set $toldVillagerAboutTeleporter = true>>
    -> Don't mention it yet
        {$playerName}: Nothing worth mentioning just yet.
        Lost Villager: I see. Well, it's good to see you again.
        Lost Villager: Let me know if you discover anything.
<<elseif $toldVillagerAboutTeleporter == true>>
    Lost Villager: Ah, {$playerName}. Good to see you again.
    Lost Villager: I've been thinking about that teleporter you mentioned.
    Lost Villager: Hopefully it really is our way out of here.
    Lost Villager: Thank you again for telling me about it.
<<else>>
    Lost Villager: Ah, {$playerName}. Good to see you again.
    Lost Villager: Have you found anything interesting?
    {$playerName}: Not yet. I'm still looking around.
    Lost Villager: I see. Well, hopefully we'll find a way out soon.
<<endif>>
===
